@prefix solid: <http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/terms#>.
<#notes> a solid:TypeRegistration;
    solid:forClass <https://schema.org/TextDigitalDocument>;
    solid:instance <{{base.path}}private/notes>.

<#binary> a solid:TypeRegistration;
    solid:forClass <https://schema.org/ImageObject>;
    solid:instance <{{base.path}}private/binary.png>.
